llar. USDT0 gives Stellar one secure, unified version of Tether&#x27;s dollar stablecoin across 26 chains with no wrapped tokens.</p><div class="MuiBox-root css-5uxyq9"><a class="MuiBox-root css-gqps4i" href="/transfer?destination=stellar&amp;token=usdt0">Transfer to <!-- -->Stellar</a><a class="MuiBox-root css-1ppzdxx" href="https://docs.usdt0.to/tutorial/how-to-transfer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How to transfer?</a></div></div></section><main class="css-1y3bzie"><section class="MuiBox-root css-13hxm4u"><h2 class="MuiBox-root css-14v7qlv">Stellar<!-- --> at a glance</h2><div class="MuiBox-root css-uc5icb"><div class="MuiBox-root css-16o9c7m" role="tablist" aria-label="Select time period"><div class="MuiBox-root css-6u0dwo" aria-hidden="true"></div><button class="MuiBox-root css-b7ftin" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">24H</button><button class="MuiBox-root css-16vgqfs" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true">30D</button><button class="MuiBox-root css-b7ftin" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false">1Y</button></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-h3bnh6"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1maqmay"><p class="MuiBox-root css-1a9ejqn">$11M</p><p class="MuiBox-root css-12kwyqn">Volume</p></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1maqmay"><p class="MuiBox-root css-1a9ejqn">$9.5M</p><p class="MuiBox-root css-12kwyqn">Current supply</p></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1maqmay"><p class="MuiBox-root css-1a9ejqn">39</p><p class="MuiBox-root css-12kwyqn">Transfers</p></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1maqmay"><p class="MuiBox-root css-1a9ejqn">$284k</p><p class="MuiBox-root css-12kwyqn">Average transfer size</p></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root css-1ax3jij"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1r7t2q6"><h2 class="MuiBox-root css-1acsvo8">Assets on <!-- -->Stellar</h2><div class="MuiBox-root css-pyjdtp"><div class="MuiBox-root css-16mt3pp"><div class="MuiBox-root css-15q091u"><div class="MuiBox-root css-pidsj4"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1l5uu7d" aria-hidden="true"></div><img class="MuiBox-root css-y5kvg5" src="/static/logo/asset_USDT0.svg" alt="USDT0"/></div><h3 class="MuiBox-root css-121ppou">USDT0<span class="MuiBox-root css-kydg2d"> <!-- -->on <!-- -->Stellar</span></h3></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-19e6rjm"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1o0h7rk"><span class="MuiBox-root css-2am2it">Contract</span><div class="MuiBox-root css-dtivr8"><span class="MuiBox-root css-3ee340">US...HN6Q</span><button class="MuiBox-root css-1oiu6k4" type="button" aria-label="Copy contract address"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" size="20" class="css-bl1iat"><mask id="copy_svg__a" style="mask-type:alpha" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="0" y="0" width="24" height="24"><path fill="#D9D9D9" d="M0 0h24v24H0z"></path></mask><g mask="url(#copy_svg__a)"><path d="M9 18c-.55 0-1.02-.196-1.412-.587A1.926 1.926 0 0 1 7 16V4c0-.55.196-1.02.588-1.413A1.926 1.926 0 0 1 9 2h9c.55 0 1.02.196 1.413.587C19.803 2.98 20 3.45 20 4v12c0 .55-.196 1.02-.587 1.413A1.926 1.926 0 0 1 18 18H9Zm0-2h9V4H9v12Zm-4 6c-.55 0-1.02-.196-1.413-.587A1.926 1.926 0 0 1 3 20V6h2v14h11v2H5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></svg></button><a class="MuiBox-root css-2p5k1l" href="https://stellar.expert/explorer/public/asset/USDT0-GATISXX6BZ6NC7IKQBY37CJD4SOZL3CYZJWXEDG6JVIY4WBS6KXJHN6Q" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View on block explorer"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" size="20" class="css-bl1iat"><g clip-path="url(#blockchainExplorer_svg__a)" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.17 3.828a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-4.95 0L6.09 4.96l-.708-.707L6.513 3.12a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 6.364 6.364l-1.131 1.132-.707-.708 1.131-1.131a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-4.95ZM3.826 12.171a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 4.95 0l1.131-1.13.707.706-1.131 1.132a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.364-6.364L4.25 5.383l.707.707-1.131 1.132a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 4.95Z"></path><path d="M5.95 9.343 9.344 5.95l.707.707-3.394 3.394-.707-.707Z"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="blockchainExplorer_svg__a"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h16v16H0z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg></a></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-1o0h7rk"><span class="MuiBox-root css-2am2it">Current supply</span><div class="MuiBox-root css-13fbum9"><span class="MuiBox-root css-3ee340">$9.54M</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root css-16ky2dg"><div class="MuiBox-root css-151rrxq"><h2 class="MuiBox-root css-1acsvo8">How to Bridge<br/>USDT to Stellar</h2><div class="MuiBox-root css-cyg3ki"><div class="MuiBox-root css-xrgnns"><div class="MuiBox-root css-16wgkgk"><img class="MuiBox-root css-1t22amj" src="/static/ecosystem/how-to-transfer/dark/wallet.webp" alt=""/></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-15pvpcn"><p class="MuiBox-root css-1u575xx">Step 1</p><h3 class="MuiBox-root css-mwaz0b">Connect your wallet</h3><p class="MuiBox-root css-1u575xx">Start by connecting the wallet you want to transfer from.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-xrgnns"><div class="MuiBox-root css-16wgkgk"><img class="MuiBox-root css-1t22amj" src="/static/ecosystem/how-to-transfer/dark/asset.webp" alt=""/></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-15pvpcn"><p class="MuiBox-root css-1u575xx">Step 2</p><h3 class="MuiBox-root css-mwaz0b">Select your asset</h3><p class="MuiBox-root css-1u575xx">Choose the asset, source network, and destination chain.</p></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-xrgnns"><div class="MuiBox-root css-16wgkgk"><img class="MuiBox-root css-1t22amj" src="/static/ecosystem/how-to-transfer/dark/confirmation.webp" alt=""/></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-15pvpcn"><p class="MuiBox-root css-1u575xx">Step 3</p><h3 class="MuiBox-root css-mwaz0b">Confirm</h3><p class="MuiBox-root css-1u575xx">Review the details and approve the transfer in your wallet. Your funds arrive on Stellar as USDT0.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root css-11eitkm"><div class="MuiBox-root css-l2sgk3" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-w7p8fh"><img class="MuiBox-root css-1v758zc" src="/static/design-icons/questionMark/dark.webp" alt=""/><h2 class="MuiBox-root css-1v4sh3p">How USDT0 Works on Stellar</h2><p class="MuiBox-root css-1yufkwb">USDT0 extends USDT to Stellar on one shared standard, so liquidity never splits into a separate bridged version. USDT0 on Stellar is the same asset across the whole network: no wrapped tokens, 1:1 backing. For users, exchanges, and applications, it works as USDT on Stellar and moves between chains in one step.</p></div></section><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is USDT0 on Stellar the same as USDT?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"USDT0 on Stellar is the USDT0 representation of USDT within the USDT0 Network. It keeps one unified USDT across supported chains instead of a separate bridged version with isolated liquidity. For users on Stellar, USDT0 works as the USDT asset available through the USDT0 system."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are transfers to and from Stellar secured?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Transfers to and from Stellar are secured by LayerZero, the interoperability protocol behind USDT0, and by the USDT0 Attestation System. The Attestation System verifies every transfer through independent attestation before it finalizes. Each message needs sign-off from the Core Attestation Set, a 3-of-3 signer group of USDT0, LayerZero, and Canary. No single verifier can approve a transfer on its own. USDT0 moves with a burn-and-mint model and 1:1 backing: no wrapped tokens, no external bridges."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the fees to bridge to and from Stellar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Moving USDT0 between Stellar and any other USDT0 Network chain has no protocol fee (0 bps). You only pay network gas on the source and destination chains. When the other side is a Legacy Mesh chain (native USDT on Solana, TON, Tron, and Celo), the transfer routes through the Legacy Mesh and costs 0.03% (3 bps), paid in USDT."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the USDT contract address on Stellar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Stellar USDT contract address is USDT0:GATISXX6BZ6NC7IKQBY37CJD4SOZL3CYZJWXEDG6JVIY4WBS6KXJHN6Q. This is the contract for the token you receive when you bridge USDT to Stellar through USDT0. Double-check the full address before sending funds."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which wallets does the USDT0 transfer widget support on Stellar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"On Stellar, the USDT0 transfer widget supports Varial, LOBSTR, Bitget, and wallets that support WalletConnect."}}]}</script><section class="MuiBox-root css-1vygcq1" data-faq-section="true"><div class="MuiBox-root css-vpj2k8"><h2 class="MuiBox-root css-1acsvo8">FAQ</h2><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" style="border-radius:16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#00805E;box-shadow:inset -1px 1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.12), inset 1px -1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open" style="display:flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_16lb75fiv5vdlb_" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_6lb75fiv5vdlb_" style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:32px;text-align:left;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none" class="faq-accordion-trigger" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="MuiBox-root css-1t1r66s">Is USDT0 on Stellar the same as USDT?</span><div class="faq-plus-btn MuiBox-root css-1dh7z8j"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1"><path d="M8 0V16M0 8H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div><div class="faq-minus-btn MuiBox-root css-1fashdo"><svg width="16" height="2" viewBox="0 0 16 2" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1;stroke:#F2F2F2"><path d="M0 1H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div></button></h3><div data-state="open" id="radix-_R_16lb75fiv5vdlb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_6lb75fiv5vdlb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="faq-accordion-content" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="faq-collapse"><div class="MuiBox-root css-3xb7l1"><div class="MuiBox-root css-187vzgg"><p class="MuiBox-root css-arf81n">USDT0 on Stellar is the USDT0 representation of USDT within the USDT0 Network. It keeps one unified USDT across supported chains instead of a separate bridged version with isolated liquidity. For users on Stellar, USDT0 works as the USDT asset available through the USDT0 system.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="border-radius:16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#1A1A1A;box-shadow:inset -1px 1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.12), inset 1px -1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" style="display:flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_1alb75fiv5vdlb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_alb75fiv5vdlb_" style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:32px;text-align:left;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none" class="faq-accordion-trigger" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="MuiBox-root css-1t1r66s">How are transfers to and from Stellar secured?</span><div class="faq-plus-btn MuiBox-root css-1dh7z8j"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1"><path d="M8 0V16M0 8H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div><div class="faq-minus-btn MuiBox-root css-1fashdo"><svg width="16" height="2" viewBox="0 0 16 2" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1;stroke:#F2F2F2"><path d="M0 1H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1alb75fiv5vdlb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_alb75fiv5vdlb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="faq-accordion-content" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="faq-collapse"><div class="MuiBox-root css-3xb7l1"><div class="MuiBox-root css-187vzgg"><p class="MuiBox-root css-arf81n">Transfers to and from Stellar are secured by LayerZero, the interoperability protocol behind USDT0, and by the USDT0 Attestation System. The Attestation System verifies every transfer through independent attestation before it finalizes. Each message needs sign-off from the Core Attestation Set, a 3-of-3 signer group of USDT0, LayerZero, and Canary. No single verifier can approve a transfer on its own. USDT0 moves with a burn-and-mint model and 1:1 backing: no wrapped tokens, no external bridges.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="border-radius:16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#1A1A1A;box-shadow:inset -1px 1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.12), inset 1px -1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" style="display:flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_1elb75fiv5vdlb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_elb75fiv5vdlb_" style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:32px;text-align:left;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none" class="faq-accordion-trigger" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="MuiBox-root css-1t1r66s">What are the fees to bridge to and from Stellar?</span><div class="faq-plus-btn MuiBox-root css-1dh7z8j"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1"><path d="M8 0V16M0 8H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div><div class="faq-minus-btn MuiBox-root css-1fashdo"><svg width="16" height="2" viewBox="0 0 16 2" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1;stroke:#F2F2F2"><path d="M0 1H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1elb75fiv5vdlb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_elb75fiv5vdlb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="faq-accordion-content" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="faq-collapse"><div class="MuiBox-root css-3xb7l1"><div class="MuiBox-root css-187vzgg"><p class="MuiBox-root css-arf81n">Moving USDT0 between Stellar and any other USDT0 Network chain has no protocol fee (0 bps). You only pay network gas on the source and destination chains. When the other side is a Legacy Mesh chain (native USDT on Solana, TON, Tron, and Celo), the transfer routes through the Legacy Mesh and costs 0.03% (3 bps), paid in USDT.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="border-radius:16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#1A1A1A;box-shadow:inset -1px 1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.12), inset 1px -1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" style="display:flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_1ilb75fiv5vdlb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_ilb75fiv5vdlb_" style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:32px;text-align:left;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none" class="faq-accordion-trigger" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="MuiBox-root css-1t1r66s">What is the USDT contract address on Stellar?</span><div class="faq-plus-btn MuiBox-root css-1dh7z8j"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1"><path d="M8 0V16M0 8H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div><div class="faq-minus-btn MuiBox-root css-1fashdo"><svg width="16" height="2" viewBox="0 0 16 2" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1;stroke:#F2F2F2"><path d="M0 1H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1ilb75fiv5vdlb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_ilb75fiv5vdlb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="faq-accordion-content" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="faq-collapse"><div class="MuiBox-root css-3xb7l1"><div class="MuiBox-root css-187vzgg"><p class="MuiBox-root css-arf81n">The Stellar USDT contract address is USDT0:GATISXX6BZ6NC7IKQBY37CJD4SOZL3CYZJWXEDG6JVIY4WBS6KXJHN6Q. This is the contract for the token you receive when you bridge USDT to Stellar through USDT0. Double-check the full address before sending funds.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="border-radius:16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#1A1A1A;box-shadow:inset -1px 1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.12), inset 1px -1px 1px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" style="display:flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_1mlb75fiv5vdlb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_mlb75fiv5vdlb_" style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:32px;text-align:left;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none" class="faq-accordion-trigger" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="MuiBox-root css-1t1r66s">Which wallets does the USDT0 transfer widget support on Stellar?</span><div class="faq-plus-btn MuiBox-root css-1dh7z8j"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1"><path d="M8 0V16M0 8H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div><div class="faq-minus-btn MuiBox-root css-1fashdo"><svg width="16" height="2" viewBox="0 0 16 2" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:relative;z-index:1;stroke:#F2F2F2"><path d="M0 1H16" stroke="#F2F2F2" stroke-width="2"></path></svg></div></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_1mlb75fiv5vdlb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_mlb75fiv5vdlb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="faq-accordion-content" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="faq-collapse"><div class="MuiBox-root css-3xb7l1"><div class="MuiBox-root css-187vzgg"><p class="MuiBox-root css-arf81n">On Stellar, the USDT0 transfer widget supports Varial, LOBSTR, Bitget, and wallets that support WalletConnect.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MuiBox-root css-mtwz3o"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1tnh8wr"><h2 class="MuiBox-root css-1acsvo8">Top <!-- -->Stellar<!-- --> Routes</h2><div class="MuiBox-root css-fij2w"><div class="MuiBox-root css-1jke4yk"><div class="MuiBox-root css-qnsy7x"><div class="MuiBox-root css-gmev3k"><div class="MuiBox-root css-6c4bb9"><div class="MuiBox-root cs